Version 0.10
~~~~~~~~~~~~
* Post DiFX-2.9
* setCODIFEpochTime: compute epoch relative to 2000 (was 2020) and wrap modulo 256 (8 bit field)
* setCODIFEpochMJD: return error before 2000 and wrap modulo 256
* incrementCODIFHeader: advance seconds by whole periods, fix wrap at exact period boundary, return error rather than assert if before epoch
* createCODIFHeader: version set consistently to 2
* getCODIFFrameperperiod now calls getCODIFFramesPerPeriod; getCODIFFrameMJDSec takes const header
* nextCODIFHeader/incrementCODIFHeader: parameter renamed frameperperiod to reflect its meaning

Version 0.9
~~~~~~~~~~~
* Added utility codifSplitChan
* Added utility fixcodif that can update headers
* Added utility codif_dsb2ssb
* Added utility codif_dumpheaders
* Set CODIF SYNC word in codif.h
* Add channel drop option, and multicast support, to codif write
* Add reuse option so multiple processes can use the same port
* Added ability to write out only headers
* Version for DiFX-2.9

Version 0.8
~~~~~~~~~~~
* Version for DiFX-2.8, Nov 4, 2022
